774	     * Derives the read-only {@code bulkSignupWarning} flag for an owner: {@code true} when more than
775	     * {@link #BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD} owners have been created (counted by
776	     * {@code registrationDate}) on the given day, otherwise {@code false}. Uses the same per-day
777	     * accumulation as {@link #rejectDailyRegistrationLimit(LocalDate)}. A {@code null} date (an owner
