794	     * {@link #identityKey(Owner)}) and is the single duplicate check: it subsumes the former separate
795	     * telephone, email and household duplicate blocks. Because the telephone is part of the key, two
796	     * owners with the same last name and postcode but <em>different</em> telephones have different
797	     * identity keys and are both allowed (the second is surfaced instead as a soft
798	     * {@code possibleDuplicate}, see {@link #possibleDuplicateOf(Owner)}); only an exact full-key match
